<title>LATVIA: Yields fall at Latvian T-bill auction.</title>
<headline>Yields fall at Latvian T-bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yields at an auction of Latvian one-month and three-month Treasury bills fell on Wednesday, the the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YLD	 LAST  NO OF BANKS    ISSUE  BID SOLD</p>
<p> One month    3.66	  3.92	 7	    0.5   1.6  0.5</p>
<p> Three-month  4.14	  4.41	 6	    1.0   2.4  1.0</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
